Arena control and observation hooks for the pinned jEEBUS sources.

WHY: heartbeat generation, missing-heartbeat detection, and failsafe timers need
one time scale. Observation errors must not escape into native state transitions.
Gradle locking and verification preserve dependency identity; compiler debug
settings retain source/line stack traces without local-variable debug tables.

